{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：人物心理变化的因果解释和前后叙事衔接不如Y充分，Y更容易让观众明白他为什么一步步产生这些念头。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的核心话语更短，重点词放大加亮，观众可以先抓住人物此刻的处境，再随着音乐出现的时机捕捉细小的情绪和音乐变化，不必一直读完整段文字。尤其在感受细腻度上，X对节奏、音型、音色、身体反应和心理波动的刻画更具体，Y则胜在把人物的动机、犹豫及前后转变解释得更连贯，但部分段落需要连续阅读较长的句子。综合边听边扫、抓重点和感受音乐细节的实际体验，我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ae6d6915-7f31-40fa-8fab-22fbeb82185d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T225001470260Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:50:56.508301+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4be61b1162942f43c871f156fc9a99c74355b9d9b80d5e3c84d09203354c1b36", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment